type of environment.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:00.860
You can use either third
party tools or something

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.640
like Data Studio, which
is a Bi tool that we have.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.190
You can share with
other people or you can

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:08.540
